## 1. Role & Task

**Role:** Senior Full-Stack Architect & AI Systems Engineer
**Task:** Build, end-to-end, a production-grade funding-assistance platform for women entrepreneurs consisting of four integrated modules — Funding Checklist, Context-Aware Scheme Matcher, Loan Application Generator, Doc Whisperer, and BizCalculus P&L Engine — with a working React frontend and a working Node/Express/MongoDB backend, fully wired together (no stubbed endpoints, no placeholder state).

**Tech Stack:**
- Frontend: React.js (Vite), Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, React Router, Axios (via a typed API service layer)
- Backend: Node.js + Express, MongoDB + Mongoose
- AI/Search: Gemini API (text generation + embeddings), faiss-node (vector similarity search for scheme matching)
- File Handling: Multer (upload) + pdf-parse (extraction)
- Auth: JWT + bcrypt

