## 2. Global Workflow & Checklist Integration Rules

| # | Rule | Trigger Condition | DB Field Updated |
|---|------|--------------------|-------------------|
| 1 | Complete Profile | User saves basic profile + business context | `checklistProgress.completeProfile = true` |
| 2 | Find Matching Scheme | Successful `POST /api/schemes/scan` with valid 100–300 word idea | `checklistProgress.findMatchingScheme = true` |
| 3 | Scan Identity Docs | Successful PDF upload + Gemini verification via Doc Whisperer | `checklistProgress.scanIdentityDocs = true` |
| 4 | Generate P&L Plan | Successful 1-year P&L generation via BizCalculus | `checklistProgress.generatePnLPlan = true` |

**Progress %** = `(tasksTrue / 4) * 100`, computed server-side and returned with every `GET /api/user/checklist` call — never computed client-side from stale state.

